@startuml delegate-communication
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #0f3460
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #dbeafe
skinparam noteBorderColor #0f3460
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #fef9c3

title Harness Delegate 通信时序图

participant "Harness Manager\n(SaaS 控制平面)" as Manager
participant "Delegate\n(用户网络)" as Delegate
participant "目标基础设施\n(K8s/Cloud)" as Target
participant "外部系统\n(SCM/Registry)" as External

== 初始化阶段 ==
Delegate -> Manager : 出站 HTTPS/WSS 连接 (TLS，永久长连接)
Manager --> Delegate : 心跳确认 + 任务订阅
note right of Manager
  只需出站 443/HTTPS
  无需入站端口开放
end note

== 任务执行阶段 ==
Manager -> Delegate : 推送任务 (via WebSocket)
note over Delegate
  任务类型：部署/构建/扫描/成本采集/混沌注入
end note
Delegate -> External : 拉取代码/镜像
External --> Delegate : 代码/制品
Delegate -> Target : 执行部署/操作
Target --> Delegate : 执行结果
Delegate -> Manager : 回传日志与状态

== 高可用与负载均衡 ==
group 多副本场景
    Manager -> Delegate : 任务分配 (基于 Selector 路由)
    note left : 同一 Selector 的多个\nDelegate 自动负载均衡
end

@enduml
